    "updated_at": "2023-06-14T12:34:26Z",
    "body": "> Consider the test 'Show a sibling popover during \"hide all popovers until' merged in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/39647/files:\r\n> \r\n> when `p16.hidePopover()` is called, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-popover-algorithm invokes https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-all-popovers-until with element `p16`. In https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-all-popovers-until, the first time after reaching step 6.3. `foundEndpoint` is true and `lastToHide` is null.\r\n\r\nThere was a reasoning mistake here, sorry. `lastToHide` will be `p18` and consequently the loop will stop.\r\n\r\n",
